WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.090
SHINING SOUL

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:44.580
And you still call yourself part of the Byakko clan?!

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.020
Not only did you try to steal data from the enemy... You even ran away after losing to them!

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.580
How pathetic can you get?!

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.330
But if they hadn't gotten in my wa—

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:53.060
Silence!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:57.720
Gao.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:58.770
Yes.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.360
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:05.380
You are no warrior right now. Reflect on how repulsive your actions were.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:07.450
In the mean time, I'll be keeping your Bey.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.220
Fine!

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:13.830
Look after him.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.040
Understood.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.160
Rai-nii...

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:26.010
Did Byakko really disappear from Rey's Bey?

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.280
Probably.

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:30.540
But this is for the best.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:37.760
Byakko is not meant for a despicable man like him.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.260
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.760
I'll go take a look at Kiki. You should get some sleep.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:46.550
Okay.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:27.340
Farewell, BBA Team

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.320
I'm telling you, Rei disappeared!

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.160
And he only left a note behind!

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.370
A note? What did it say?

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.520
Just one sentence. "I'm quitting the BBA Team."

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:41.950
What the heck is wrong with him?! I don't get this at all!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:44.790
I see...

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:48.070
You don't look worried at all, President.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:50.240
Do you know something we don't?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.080
Well...

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:55.670
The truth is, Rei came to me early this morning.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:57.890
What did he say?!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:05.230
"The Sacred Beast left my Beyblade. As I am now, I'll only be holding back the BBA Team."

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.200
"Please let me leave the team."

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.700
And?! Did you just let him go like that?!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.800
I stopped him.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.210
But he was very determined in his choice.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:21.430
He is not the kind of person who would do something like this lightly.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:25.200
I'm sure he went though a lot of distress before making his choice.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:29.600
I simply desire to respect his decision.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:40.290
The cause must be last night's events. I had no idea that it was troubling him that much.

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:45.340
Rei's not going to say <i>'goodbye'</i>
to us and leave like that, is he?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.390
Alright! I'll go ascertain that!

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.020
Ascertain that... How exactly?

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.360
I'll look for Rei!

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:58.280
I know he's going though hard times. But I can't accept him leaving without saying a word to us!

00:04:58.280 --> 00:04:59.200
Let it go.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:00.100
Kai!

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:04.110
If you have time to waste, go train. We have a match tomorrow.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:09.270
Why are you always so cold? We might never see one of our comrades again, you know?

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:10.800
I'm not so sure about that.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:11.860
Why?

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:19.220
Rei's not the kind of guy to just give up like that. I'm sure he's doing all he can to get Byakko back.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.770
If he succeeds in doing that, I'm sure Rei will come back to us in due time.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.470
You want him to come back too, don't you Kai?

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.690
Don't get me wrong.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:31.590
What I want is Rei's strength alone.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.740
Take this! Have a taste of the <i>real</i> Tiger Claw!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:41.440
After all, if our BBA Team isn't strong enough, we won't survive this tournament.

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:49.290
Indeed, what Kai says makes sense. The only thing we can do right now is wait.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.630
But the possibility that we'll
never see him again still remains!

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.850
Yeah, I can't let things stay like this!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.050
Takao!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.130
Driger! Bring out your true power!

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.020
You should be able to break a rock that big!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:28.070
It's useless... Such training
won't bring Byakko back to me.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.410
Driger, one more time.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.810
Go... Shoot!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.640
Galux?!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.190
Mao!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.300
Why are you here? Stop Galux.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:58.820
Galux, go all out.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.740
I don't want to fight anyone.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.990
Hmpf! You can't even land a decent attack, can you?

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.030
Cat Fang!

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.430
Stop!

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:27.620
Galux!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:49.890
I've been following you all day.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.960
I wanted to make sure what Kiki said was true.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:01.680
So it's true... Byakko left you.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:05.630
I'll take him back. That's why I'm going though this training here.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.170
It's pointless!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:11.340
You should know as well what <i>the real reason</i> Byakko abandoned you is.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.750
If you're not going to say it, I will.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:20.400
You said this earlier...
"I don't want to fight anyone."

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.980
It's not "anyone"! You don't want to fight with <i>us</i>!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.490
You don't want to fight against the Byakko Clan!

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.250
This is what you're thinking deep down!

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.560
<i>This</i> is the reason Byakko is not with you!

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:36.040
Can you really step on your comrades and think nothing of it?! Tell me, Rei!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:55.050
Come back... Come back with us to the Byakko Clan.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.810
If you do, you won't have to fight against Rai-nii!

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.100
And Byakko will surely come back too, Rei-nii!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.820
The boy from this picture is on that mountain?

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:26.390
That's right. Go see for yourself.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.140
Thanks...

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:32.640
This is a problem... Did Rei really climb all the way up there?

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.260
Takao!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:35.640
Max!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.610
<i>Catch!</i>

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:41.580
Man, you're really fast! It took
me a long time to catch up!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.060
Why are you here?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.470
I followed the Professor's advice and chased you from China Tower.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:50.690
The Professor's is busy with the paperwork
for tomorrow's match, so I came alone.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.530
You came here to stop me?

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:55.260
I agree with Kai's way of thinking.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.700
Byakko is Rei's problem.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.410
We can't do anything about it.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.970
I know that already...

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.060
Then why are you here..?

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.250
Why, you say...

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:07.470
He's doing his best all by himself.

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:13.180
There's just one thing I really wanted to let him know...

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.520
You wanted to let him know..?

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.080
Well, nevermind that.

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:21.140
Anyway, I'll be back by evening. Tell Professor not to worry.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.100
See you later!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.430
<i>Hey!</i>

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.550
It's impossible for you to climb that mountain alone.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:29.280
What, are you making fun of me?!

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:34.420
And that is why I, who's expert in rock climbing, will show you how to do it.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.990
Also, I <i>am</i> a tiny bit worried about Rei.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:44.070
Three, Two, One!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.390
Go... Shoot!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:03.160
What's there to think about, Rei-nii?

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:08.690
Byakko's power will never come back as long as you're enemies with the Byakko Clan.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.160
So you're telling me to go back to the Clan?

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.360
That's precisely it!

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:16.890
Rei-nii... Being together with
all of us is what fits you the best!

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.860
You were so cool back in the day, Rei-nii!

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:23.710
You were always there for us... You were like our leader.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:27.000
When it came to BeyBattles you
were the strongest in the Clan!

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:33.030
That's right. Long ago, when you were still a small child...

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:41.220
At that time, your Bey didn't have a Sacred Beast inside,

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.350
but you were still really strong.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.490
Rei-nii!

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:51.170
Rai-nii and I both looked up to you.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.490
Yes, I was strong back then.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:03.690
But that's only true compared to the rest of the Byakko Clan.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.620
That wasn't enough for me.

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.070
What do you mean?

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:12.180
At one point, I started thinking this:

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.340
"Am I really strong?"

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:20.170
"Will I still be the strongest Blader, even outside the Byakko Clan?" Things like that.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:25.990
But the Clan's rules forbade BeyBattles with opponents outside the Clan itself.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:38.440
Since the dawn of time, the Byakko Clan has been a tribe that fights from the shadows.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:47.850
Using weapons similar to Beyblades, they've been supporting the Imperial Court for centuries.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:53.210
And at the core of the tradition were the Sacred Bests that lived inside those weapons.

00:12:55.000 --> 00:13:00.480
In time, the Clan's rules began to strictly forbid contacts with the outside world.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:06.710
But I couldn't take the Clan's oppressive way of life.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.700
I wanted to see the outer world and test my ability.

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:15.970
I wanted to get stronger!

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:22.240
Even the Clan's strict rules weren't enough for me to hold those feelings back.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:26.630
And that is when I left the Byakko Clan.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.740
Go!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.730
The outside world was beyond my expectations.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.710
I'm not gonna let you!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.140
I fought battles that would have never been possible in the Clan.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.710
And I had the chance to meet all sorts of Bladers.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.590
But still, Rei-nii...

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:53.440
Wasn't Byakko the whole reason you were able to win all those battles?

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.650
Yes, that's true.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:14:00.630
I wouldn't have been able to defeat many of my opponents without Byakko's power.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.410
But from now on..!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.120
Yes. It's going to be different.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:10.930
What are you going to do? Will you really be able to go on without Byakko's power?

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.530
Can you win against the world without Byakko?

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:20.250
Then why don't you give up on that and just come back to the Clan? Come on!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:23.760
Rei-nii!

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:28.470
You have a point.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:34.340
Now that I don't have Byakko, I may be hopeless as you say.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.850
Are you fine with that?!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.650
Takao! Max!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:41.380
Are you really okay with that?! Byak—

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:46.130
You're being too hyper, Takao! Finish the climb first, okay?

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:52.740
Byakko left you, so you're just going to throw away your dream of facing the world?!

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.310
But as I am now, without Byakko...

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.960
Rei-nii! You don't need to listen to these idiots!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.710
So that's all it takes for you to give up on your dream?! I'm disap—

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:10.710
Rei... We thought you were doing everything in your power to get Byakko back.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:15.720
Takao came all the way here because he had something to say to you.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:19.030
And yet, look at what's going on...

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.440
Something to say to me?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.580
I don't feel like talking to you now!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.960
Have you really given up on your dream? Are you sure?

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.440
Tell me, Rei!

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:31.200
Rei-nii!

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:36.900
Okay, then how about this.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.630
A BeyBattle! You against me!

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:41.520
If you win, you can do whatever you want.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:44.500
Go back to the Byakko Clan, whatever. I don't care.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:49.540
But if I win... Rei, I'm taking you back and I'll make you open your eyes!

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.110
I'll fight you!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:59.420
If you want to battle that bad, I'll be your opponent! How's that?

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:00.450
Mao!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.580
He challenged me. I will fight.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.860
But, Rei-nii, right now Byakko is—

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.450
No,

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:08.490
it's okay.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.030
Can I really win this?

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:40.980
With this Driger that doesn't have Byakko's power?

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.760
I'm not holding back, you know.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.030
I know.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.770
Take him down, Rei-nii!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:52.790
Like you did in the past, in the village battles! Tear him to pieces!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.620
The village battles...

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:59.290
That's right! At that time, I was strong even without the Sacred Beast's power!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.300
How could I forget that?

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.570
I got it, Mao.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.160
Let's go, Rei!

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.050
Yeah!

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:10.200
Three, Two, One!

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:11.450
Go... Shoot!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.690
Go, Driger!

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:21.880
Go, Dragoon!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.850
Okay, use your Storm Attack!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:36.260
This power! Takao is really going all out!

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.050
Don't lose, Rei-nii!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:44.350
It's been a long time sine I last faced your Storm Attack. But my Driger won't just sit and take the hit!

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.970
What's wrong? Are you running away?!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:52.300
You're wrong. Takao, you haven't realized that this place gives Driger an advantage.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.060
What?!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.390
Driger! Tiger Claw!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.400
Oh crap!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.730
I knew you had it in you!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.300
So what? It's no big deal!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.550
Stop Driger, Dragoon!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:21.390
The wind is... getting weaker.

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.550
Rei-nii!

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:42.790
<i>Winner is</i> Rei!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.740
You win. Do what you want.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.420
Takao.

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.090
What is it you wanted to say to me?

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.940
I guess I can tell you now.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.420
I just wanted to tell you this.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:14.800
"Even if you don't have Byakko's power, you're still one of us in the BBA Team." That's all.

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:16.610
I see...

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.270
Mao, forgive me.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.410
I'm going back to the BBA.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:29.810
I feel like I want to see how far my skills will take me without Byakko's power.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:35.000
Just like in the past, when the Bey I fought with didn't have a Sacred Beast.

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:43.610
The ones who made me remember that were Takao... and you, Mao.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.320
Rei-nii...

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.740
Can I come back?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.910
Sure you can, anytime! Right?

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.170
<i>Of course!</i>

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:57.300
There's <i>no problem</i> whatsoever!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:00.580
We knew you were coming back to us! Right Max?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:01.380
Right you are!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.820
Rei-nii...

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:04.730
You have some great comrades.

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:06.260
Mao!

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.810
Stay away from this scum.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:10.820
Rai-nii!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:11.970
When did you..?!

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:14.790
Do you have any idea what I went through to find you?

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:17.370
Let's stop fighting among ourselves!

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:20.240
Don't you remember? How we used to look up to Rei-nii?

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:24.850
Indeed, we <i>used to</i> look up to him. But right now, he's nothing but a traitor!

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:27.620
Exactly because I know the old Rei, I can't forgive him.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:27.650
But..!
Exactly because I know the old Rei, I can't forgive him.

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:28.220
But..!

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:28.850
Rei.

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:33.140
Now that you don't have Byakko you're like a baby. I <i>will</i> crush you.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.460
It won't be that easy.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:39.110
Exactly! Rei has us by his side!

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.110
The <i>winners</i> will be us. <i>Okay?</i>

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:41.840
Let's go, Mao.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.540
He ignored us!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.290
Wow!

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:55.280
Anyone in the Byakko Clan can do stuff like that.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:56.640
R-Really?

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:58.680
We should go back too.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:03.150
Oh yeah... We have to go down too, don't we.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.050
What's wrong?

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:08.480
You could say that going down is scarier than going up... or something.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.340
Do you want to climb some more?

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.750
Rei, I've just had a great idea!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:17.140
<i>You</i> could carry us and jump down like Rai and Mao did!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:18.110
Not happening.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:21.750
You came all the way here on your own. You're going back down on your own.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:22.980
Oh come on!

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:31.250
But seriously, will you carry us down?

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:03.360
According to my analysis, isn't that the Mongolian team, descendants of the blue wolves?

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:07.460
And going up against them is the Chinese team lead by Rai!

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:09.760
Both teams are really strong!

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:16.800
During the battle, Rai finally starts unveiling the truth about his and Rei's past.

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:20.700
Next rime: Scream, Rei! Roar, Byakko!

00:23:20.700 --> 00:23:23.660
Anyway, <i>he</i> came back at last.
